SUMMARY:Back Alley Garden Refresher – Please Help!
LOCATION:
DESCRIPTION:After two years\, the planting area along Town Run at Back Alley needs refreshment and renewal.  Adding priority to this effort\, the area has been selected for the Shepherdstown Community Club’s Backyard Garden tour coming up in two months on May 16 and 17. Town Run Watershed Group’s Restoration Project Leader\, Peggy Bowers\, has developed […]
