SUMMARY:Homeowner Septic Workshop
LOCATION:
DESCRIPTION:Join Alexis Davy from Jefferson County Health Department and Sky Brown from West Virginia Conservation Agency for a homeowner's workshop on caring for and maintaining your septic system. Information will be shared on available cost-share programs for residents in Jefferson County to pump out and maintain septic systems. This event will be held on June […]
